{"id": "text-8ee21a", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": 43.0, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response states the same facts as the reference: a carrying value of $119 billion, representing 43% of total consolidated assets as of December 31, 2023. It is fully correct and complete.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": true, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0010619000000000002, "latency_s": 2.9346371999999974, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-658abe", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": 1.0, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response gives approximately 1.0% of annual net trade sales for fiscal 2024, which matches the reference answer and the filing. Leaving out the 2023 and 2022 figures is not a meaningful omission, because the question asks only about 2024.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": true, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0009128400000000002, "latency_s": 3.6816485000017565, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-2eda6b", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response is correct and complete. It names the favorable performance of Costa in the United Kingdom as the primary driver of favorable channel mix, which matches the reference. It also accurately notes the offsets from unfavorable product mix and the loss of COVID-related incentives. Mentioning pricing initiatives is accurate extra context from the filing.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": true, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.00106608, "latency_s": 4.56685490000018, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-c21c2e", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response correctly identifies the first fiscal quarter and gives the reason, seasonal holiday demand, both matching the reference. The added point about new product introductions is accurate per the 10-K and contradicts nothing.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": true, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.00083734, "latency_s": 3.106038699999772, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-20b6e4", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response matches the reference. It names both causes of the uncertainty: limited historical trend information, and the absence of standardized, reliable and comprehensive greenhouse gas emissions data. It also includes the stated consequence of inaccurate disclosures or financial reporting.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": true, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0008039200000000002, "latency_s": 3.437903699999879, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-82a7c1", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response matches the reference on both parts. It says the laws require certain data to be maintained, stored and/or processed within the country of origin, and that maintaining local data centers could significantly increase operating costs. The added note that no dollar amount is quantified is accurate and does not contradict anything.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": true, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.00098328, "latency_s": 3.36663939999562, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-5ae9af", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response states the core point exactly: generative AI use in internal systems may create new attack surfaces or methods for adversaries. The additional points, that security controls may not keep pace and that threat actors may use AI, are plausible extra context from the filing and do not contradict the reference answer.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": true, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.001019, "latency_s": 2.9104842000015196, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-1f136d", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response matches the reference on both reasons: customers can keep account balances with Amazon and transfer money to third parties, and Amazon provides services that facilitate payments on behalf of third parties. It also lists the requirements those jurisdictions impose (licensing, inspection, bonding and capital, fund handling, disclosures, data processing, authentication). This is consistent with the 10-K's language and does not conflict with the reference.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": true, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.00097836, "latency_s": 3.279844199994841, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-889092", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": -29.0, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response matches the reference answer: the 29% decline in XBOX hardware revenue was driven by a lower volume of consoles sold. It is fully correct and complete.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": true, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0007529000000000001, "latency_s": 3.155677200000355, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-3711e8", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": 165000.0, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response matches the reference exactly. It says nearly 165,000 clinical professionals out of more than 390,000 employees as of December 31, 2025.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": true, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.00062206, "latency_s": 3.0678944000028423, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-39d772", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": 20.0, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response matches the reference on every point. It gives the 20% growth figure, names increased customer usage as the primary driver, and names pricing changes from long-term customer contracts as the partial offset.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": true, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0008722, "latency_s": 3.2801211000005424, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-814331", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": 11.7, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response is fully correct and complete. It gives the right figure, approximately 11.7% of total revenues in fiscal 2024. It also states the expected 2025 impact correctly: continued launches of biosimilar versions in Europe and the U.S., per patent settlement and license agreements. Both parts match the reference answer.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": true, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.00102054, "latency_s": 3.5824436000002606, "error": ""}
